OL,4,CTrump faces backlash after saying he   
OL,5,C'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO    
OL,6,CJensen Huang                           
OL,7,GJensen Huang has been reinstated as    
OL,8,Gthe boss of Nvidia less than two weeks 
OL,9,Gafter he was forced to resign          
OL,10,Gfollowing the revelations of extra     
OL,11,Gmarital affairs, one of which was with 
OL,12,Ga suspected Chinese spy.               
OL,14,FThe AI chipmaker handed its co-founder 
OL,15,Fhis job back, despite rejecting his    
OL,16,Finitial offer to return, after         
OL,17,Fpressure from US President Donald      
OL,18,FTrump.                                 
